sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant C as Client
  participant API as Server (Express)
  participant DB as MongoDB
  participant AN as Analysis service (FastAPI)
  participant EXT as Crossref / OpenAlex / S2
  S->>C: Upload DOCX, choose checks, enter requirements
  C->>API: POST /api/documents (file)
  API->>API: extract text, abstract, references
  API->>DB: save document
  C->>API: POST /api/checks {documentId, checks, requirements}
  API->>DB: create checkJob (status=queued)
  API-->>C: 202 {jobId}
  par Reference check (server)
    API->>EXT: resolve DOI / HTTP HEAD each URL
    API->>DB: save reference results
  and Analysis (service)
    API->>AN: POST /analyze/citations, /abstract, /requirements, /topic
    AN->>EXT: fetch source abstracts / OA text
    AN->>AN: retrieve fragment, NLI label, summary, rules, similarity
    AN->>API: POST /internal/jobs/{id}/result
    API->>DB: save analysis results
  end
  loop every 3–5 s
    C->>API: GET /api/checks/{jobId}
    API-->>C: status, progress
  end
  C->>API: GET /api/checks/{jobId}/report
  API-->>C: report JSON
  C-->>S: report with statuses and evidence
